.79-1.56 1.056-1.56Zm2.597 4.333h3.164a5.983 5.983 0 0 1 0 3.329h-3.164a19.528 19.528 0 0 0 0-3.33Zm2.772-1.004H12.49c-.179-1.23-.485-2.335-.914-3.12a6.023 6.023 0 0 1 3.801 3.12ZM8.44 5.212c-.43.785-.736 1.89-.914 3.12H4.638a6.023 6.023 0 0 1 3.802-3.12Zm-3.802 8.456h2.888c.178 1.23.484 2.335.914 3.12a6.023 6.023 0 0 1-3.802-3.12Zm6.938 3.12c.43-.785.735-1.89.914-3.12h2.887a6.023 6.023 0 0 1-3.801 3.12Z"></path></svg>Visit Website</a></li></ul></div></div><div><div class="duet--article--map-card hkfm3h0" data-slug="vavela-cafe" id="vavela-cafe"><div class="hkfm3h2"></div><div class="hkfm3h3"><h2 class="hkfm3h5">Vavela Cafe</h2><span class="hkfm3h6"><button type="button" class="_6ylzph0" aria-label="Save to a list"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="2 2 20 20" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7.2002 20.3202L12.4176 15.0407L17.6349 20.3202V8.24064C17.6349 5.67699 15.43 3.6001 12.7113 3.6001H7.2002V20.3202Z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7"></path></svg></button></span></div><p class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup duet--article--standard-paragraph u67w0ti va4xi81 va4xi80 e8cira1 hkfm3h9">Finally, a place to take a date for coffee and a delicious sweet treat <em>after</em> dinner or into the night (it’s open ‘til midnight or 1 a.m. on weekends). This massive (4,500 square feet to be exact), locally-owned coffee shop in the university area opened in February and offers Turkish coffee, among other juice refreshers and American-style flavored frappuccinos and lattes, as well as Arabian or Moroccan mint tea. Also on the menu are paninis and salads, but the true draw, according to the bustling and regularly crowded house, is the dazzling dessert case, with a variety of cheesecakes, cakes, pistachio kunafa, or Dubai chocolate-inspired sweets and cakes. Order at the counter and then nestle into a corner booth or the center Turkish-style seating nook with drapes and pillows.</p><div class="iyvbja0"><button type="button" class="iyvbja1" aria-pressed="false"><svg width="12" height="10" viewBox="0 0 12 10" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path fill="currentColor" d="M11.2226 0.779264C10.1836 -0.259755 8.49832 -0.259755 7.4593 0.779264L6.00095 2.23761L4.5426 0.779264C3.50359 -0.259755 1.81828 -0.259755 0.779264 0.779264C-0.259755 1.81828 -0.259755 3.50359 0.779264 4.5426L6.00007 9.76341L11.2209 4.5426C12.2599 3.50359 12.2599 1.81828 11.2209 0.779264H11.2226Z"></path></svg>Loved it</button><button type="button" class="iyvbja1" aria-pressed="false"><svg width="12" height="10" viewBox="0 0 12 10" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path fill="currentColor" d="M11.9998 1.90244L10.0973 0L3.91706 6.17935L1.90244 4.16474L0 6.06808L3.91706 9.98514L11.9998 1.90244Z"></path></svg>Want to try</button></div><ul class="hkfm3hb"><li class="hkfm3hd hkfm3hc"><a class="_1win6by0" target="_blank" href="https://lyft.sng.link/Ednq0/5pb9?_dl=lyft%3A%2F%2Fbook-a-ride%3Fdestination%5Baddress%5D%3D440+McCullough+Dr%2C+Charlotte%2C+NC%2C+28262%2C+US&amp;utm_source=eater&amp;utm_medium=eaterapp&amp;utm_campaign=CheckLyft2026_Eater_Awareness_CLT_VenueDestination&amp;utm_term=CheckLyft2026_Eater_Awareness_CLT_VenueDestination&amp;utm_content=CheckLyft2026_Eater_Awareness_CLT_VenueDestination_Static&amp;_smtype=3" rel="noreferrer nofollow"><img class="_1win6by1" src="/static-assets/icons/lyft.png" alt="" aria-hidden="true" width="17" height="12"/>Get there with Lyft<svg class="_1win6by2" width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M8.85017 5.58349L5.68241 2.38336L6.25987 1.79999L10.5 6.05807L6.39998 10.2L5.82251 9.61662L8.99818 6.40849L1.5 6.40849V5.58349L8.85017 5.58349Z"></path></svg></a></li><li><a class="hkfm3he" target="_blank" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Vavela%