 6.023 0 0 1-3.801 3.12Z"></path></svg>Visit Website</a></li></ul></div></div><div><div class="duet--article--map-card hkfm3h0" data-slug="surefire-market" id="surefire-market"><div class="hkfm3h2"></div><div class="hkfm3h3"><h2 class="hkfm3h5">Surefire Market</h2><span class="hkfm3h6"><button type="button" class="_6ylzph0" aria-label="Save to a list"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="2 2 20 20" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7.2002 20.3202L12.4176 15.0407L17.6349 20.3202V8.24064C17.6349 5.67699 15.43 3.6001 12.7113 3.6001H7.2002V20.3202Z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7"></path></svg></button></span></div><p class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup duet--article--standard-paragraph u67w0ti va4xi81 va4xi80 e8cira1 hkfm3h9">Part essentials market, part sandwich joint, this Camp North End cornershop has quickly installed itself among the best of Charlotte sandwich lore. The menu consists of three double-smashed burgers and three chicken sandwiches, to be doused with your creamy smack sauce or kicky mambo sauce. The “honey butta” chicken sandwich features a crispy on the outside and juicy and tender on the inside heaping fried chicken portion that dwarfs the bun. The slaw and pickles crunch while the slather of honey butter smooths and brightens the bite.</p><div class="iyvbja0"><button type="button" class="iyvbja1" aria-pressed="false"><svg width="12" height="10" viewBox="0 0 12 10" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path fill="currentColor" d="M11.2226 0.779264C10.1836 -0.259755 8.49832 -0.259755 7.4593 0.779264L6.00095 2.23761L4.5426 0.779264C3.50359 -0.259755 1.81828 -0.259755 0.779264 0.779264C-0.259755 1.81828 -0.259755 3.50359 0.779264 4.5426L6.00007 9.76341L11.2209 4.5426C12.2599 3.50359 12.2599 1.81828 11.2209 0.779264H11.2226Z"></path></svg>Loved it</button><button type="button" class="iyvbja1" aria-pressed="false"><svg width="12" height="10" viewBox="0 0 12 10" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path fill="currentColor" d="M11.9998 1.90244L10.0973 0L3.91706 6.17935L1.90244 4.16474L0 6.06808L3.91706 9.98514L11.9998 1.90244Z"></path></svg>Want to try</button></div><ul class="hkfm3hb"><li class="hkfm3hc"><a class="_1bchjq50" target="_blank" href="https://www.grubhub.com/restaurant/surefire-neighborhood-market-301-camp-road-charlotte/15433936?affiliate=1194&amp;utm_source=eater-affiliate-network&amp;utm_medium=affiliate&amp;utm_campaign=1194&amp;utm_content=15433936" rel="noreferrer nofollow"><svg class="_1bchjq51" id="Layer_1" data-name="Layer 1" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><defs><clipPath id="grubhub-logo-clip"><rect fill="none" x="2.5" y="3.99" width="15" height="11.35"></rect></clipPath></defs><g clip-path="url(#grubhub-logo-clip)"><g><path fill="#ff5500" d="M6.39,15.22c-2.37,0-3.73-1.99-3.73-5.45s1.4-5.66,3.81-5.66,3.34,1.58,3.47,4.22h-2.41c-.12-1.34-.47-2.11-1.07-2.11s-1.34,1.24-1.34,3.55.47,3.39,1.36,3.39,1.05-.75,1.16-1.86h-1.42v-2.13h3.73c-.04,1.97-.04,4.48,0,5.9h-1.54l-.1-.71c-.49.57-1.11.87-1.89.87h-.02Z"></path><path fill="#ff5500" d="M17.34,4.23v10.82h-2.39v-4.3h-1.58v4.3h-2.37V4.23h2.37v4.4h1.58v-4.4h2.39Z"></path></g></g></svg>Order delivery from Grubhub<svg class="_1bchjq52" width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M8.85017 5.58349L5.68241 2.38336L6.25987 1.79999L10.5 6.05807L6.39998 10.2L5.82251 9.61662L8.99818 6.40849L1.5 6.40849V5.58349L8.85017 5.58349Z"></path></svg></a></li><li class="hkfm3hd hkfm3hc"><a class="_1win6by0" target="_blank" href="https://lyft.sng.link/Ednq0/5pb9?_dl=lyft%3A%2F%2Fbook-a-ride%3Fdestination%5Baddress%5D%3D301+Camp+Road%2C+Charlotte%2C+North+Carolina+28206%2C+United+States&amp;utm_source=eater&amp;utm_medium=eaterapp&amp;utm_campaign=Check