l:9805170230"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="hkfm3hf" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none"><title>Phone</title><path fill="inherit" fill-rule="evenodd" d="M8.09 5.44c.435.373.435 1.056 0 1.49L6.909 8.172c.807 1.8 2.61 3.601 4.413 4.47l1.244-1.242a1.09 1.09 0 0 1 1.554 0l1.554 1.552a1.086 1.086 0 0 1 0 1.553l-1.554 1.552C11.384 18.789.754 8.11 3.427 5.44l1.555-1.614a1.09 1.09 0 0 1 1.554 0L8.09 5.44Z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg>(980) 517-0230</a></li><li><a class="hkfm3he" target="_blank" href="https://www.esoartisanalpasta.com/" rel="noreferrer nofollow"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="hkfm3hf hkfm3hg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none"><title>Link</title><path fill="inherit" d="M16.618 13.303a6.97 6.97 0 0 0 .39-2.303 6.97 6.97 0 0 0-.412-2.366C15.624 5.935 13.038 4 10.008 4 6.978 4 4.392 5.935 3.42 8.634A6.97 6.97 0 0 0 3.008 11a6.97 6.97 0 0 0 .412 2.366C4.392 16.066 6.978 18 10.008 18c3.03 0 5.616-1.935 6.588-4.634a.481.481 0 0 0 .022-.063Zm-6.61 3.694c-.267 0-.697-.483-1.056-1.56a10.993 10.993 0 0 1-.413-1.769h2.938c-.101.65-.24 1.248-.414 1.769-.359 1.077-.789 1.56-1.055 1.56Zm-1.59-4.332a18.586 18.586 0 0 1 0-3.33h3.18a18.602 18.602 0 0 1 0 3.33h-3.18ZM4.01 11c0-.577.082-1.136.235-1.664h3.165a19.528 19.528 0 0 0 0 3.329H4.246A5.98 5.98 0 0 1 4.011 11Zm5.997-5.997c.266 0 .696.483 1.056 1.56.173.52.312 1.119.413 1.77H8.539c.1-.651.24-1.25.413-1.77.36-1.077.79-1.56 1.056-1.56Zm2.597 4.333h3.164a5.983 5.983 0 0 1 0 3.329h-3.164a19.528 19.528 0 0 0 0-3.33Zm2.772-1.004H12.49c-.179-1.23-.485-2.335-.914-3.12a6.023 6.023 0 0 1 3.801 3.12ZM8.44 5.212c-.43.785-.736 1.89-.914 3.12H4.638a6.023 6.023 0 0 1 3.802-3.12Zm-3.802 8.456h2.888c.178 1.23.484 2.335.914 3.12a6.023 6.023 0 0 1-3.802-3.12Zm6.938 3.12c.43-.785.735-1.89.914-3.12h2.887a6.023 6.023 0 0 1-3.801 3.12Z"></path></svg>Visit Website</a></li></ul><div class="hkfm3ha"><div class="_14k72og0"><div class="_14k72og2 _14k72og1 sticky-nav-trigger"></div><div class="_1fao6gze"></div></div></div></div></div><div><div class="duet--article--map-card hkfm3h0" data-slug="spaghett" id="spaghett"><div class="hkfm3h2"></div><div class="hkfm3h3"><h2 class="hkfm3h5">Spaghett</h2><span class="hkfm3h6"><button type="button" class="_6ylzph0" aria-label="Save to a list"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="2 2 20 20" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7.2002 20.3202L12.4176 15.0407L17.6349 20.3202V8.24064C17.6349 5.67699 15.43 3.6001 12.7113 3.6001H7.2002V20.3202Z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7"></path></svg></button></span></div><p class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup duet--article--standard-paragraph u67w0ti va4xi81 va4xi80 e8cira1 hkfm3h9">Mixologist Amanda Britton and chef Kendall Moore are the dynamic duo running Spaghett, an Italian restaurant in Uptown’s Fourth Ward. Setting up in a historic 19th-century home, the spirited ambiance and decor are standouts — think moss green walls adorned with Campari art from local North Carolina artists. While a cozier front dining room with an ornate fireplace feels perfect for intimate, private conversations, a neon-lit dining area toward the back feels right for convivial, louder conversations. Ask the server what is the freshest that day — be it a crisp salad of hyper-local produce, or one of Moore’s delightful, satisfying handmade pastas cooked perfectly al dente. A three-course prix fixe menu is an excellent value at $60.</p><div class="iyvbja0"><button type="button" class="iyvbja1" aria-pressed="false"><svg width="12" height="10" viewBox="0 0 12 10" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path fill="currentColor" d="M11.2226 0.779264C10.1836 -0.259755 8.49832 -0.259755 7.4593 0.779264L6.00095 2.23761L4.5426 0.779264C3.50359 -0.259755 1.81828 -0.259755 0.779264 0.779264C-0.259755 1.81828 -0.259755 3.50359 0.779264 4.5426L6.00007 9.76341L11.2209 4.5426C12.2599 3.50359 12.2599 1.81828 11.2209 0.779264H11.2226Z"></path></svg>Loved it</button><button type="button" class="iyvbja1" aria-pressed="false"><svg width="12" height="10" viewBox="0 0 12 10" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path fill="currentColor" d="M11.9998 1.90244L10.0973 0L3.91706 6.17935L1.90244 4.16474L0 6.06808L3.91706 9.98514L11.9998 1.90244Z"></path></svg>Want to try</button></div><ul class="hkfm3hb"><li class="hkfm3hc"><div class="_1motwwz0"><a class="_1motwwz1" href="https://reservations.safegraph.com/reserve/239750?utm_source=safegraph&amp;utm_campaign=poi" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer nofollow"><svg class="_1motwwz2" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>Booking</title><path fill="currentColor" d="M12.85,2.19c.39,0,.7.31.7.7v.72h1.43c1.17,0,2.12.95,2.12,2.12v9.96c0,1.17-.95,2.12-2.12,2.12H5.02c-1.17,0-2.12-.95-2.12-2.12V5.73c0-1.17.95-2.12,2.12-2.12h1.44v-.72c0-.39.31-.7.7-.7.39,0,.7.31.7.7v.72h4.29v-.72c0-.39.31-.7.7-.7ZM4.3,9.28v6.41c0,.4.32.72.72.72h9.96c.4,0,.72-.32.72-.72v-6.41H4.3ZM5.02,5.01c-.4,0-.72.32-.72.72v2.14h11.4v-2.14c0-.4-.32-.72-.72-.72h-1.43v.72c0,.39-.31.7-.7.7-.39,0-.7-.31-.7-.7v-.72h-4.29v.72c0,.39-.31.7-.7.7-.39,0-.7-.31-.7-.7v-.72h-1.44Z"></path></svg>Book a table<svg class="_1motwwz3" width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M8.85017 5.58349L5.68241 2.38336L6.25987 1.79999L10.5 6.05807L6.39998 10.2L5.82251 9.61662L8.99818 6.40849L1.5 6.40849V5.58349L8.85017 5.58349Z"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class="hkfm3hd hkfm3hc"><a class="_1win6by0" target="_blank" href="https://lyft.sng.link/Ednq0/5pb9?_dl=lyft%3A%2F%2Fbook-a-ride%3Fdestination%5Baddress%5D%3D224+West+10th+Street%2C+Charlotte%2C+North+Carolina+28202%2C+United+States&amp;utm_source=eater&amp;utm_medium=eaterapp&amp;utm_campaign=CheckLyft2026_Eater_Awarene