 1.89-.914 3.12H4.638a6.023 6.023 0 0 1 3.802-3.12Zm-3.802 8.456h2.888c.178 1.23.484 2.335.914 3.12a6.023 6.023 0 0 1-3.802-3.12Zm6.938 3.12c.43-.785.735-1.89.914-3.12h2.887a6.023 6.023 0 0 1-3.801 3.12Z"></path></svg>Visit Website</a></li></ul><div class="hkfm3ha"><div class="_14k72og0"><div class="_14k72og2 _14k72og1 sticky-nav-trigger"></div><div class="_1fao6gze"></div></div></div></div></div><div><div class="duet--article--map-card hkfm3h0" data-slug="clark-s-snack-bar" id="clark-s-snack-bar"><div class="hkfm3h2"></div><div class="hkfm3h3"><h2 class="hkfm3h5">Clark’s Snack Bar</h2><span class="hkfm3h6"><button type="button" class="_6ylzph0" aria-label="Save to a list"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="2 2 20 20" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7.2002 20.3202L12.4176 15.0407L17.6349 20.3202V8.24064C17.6349 5.67699 15.43 3.6001 12.7113 3.6001H7.2002V20.3202Z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7"></path></svg></button></span></div><p class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup duet--article--standard-paragraph u67w0ti va4xi81 va4xi80 e8cira1 hkfm3h9">Clark’s Snack Bar<strong></strong></p><p class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup duet--article--standard-paragraph u67w0ti va4xi81 va4xi80 e8cira1 hkfm3h9">Wieners, burgers, and sandwiches are so back — at least at Clark’s Snack Bar, and a lot of hungry Charlotteans think so, too. This red, blue, and retro cavern churns out kraut-ey kielbasas, pastrami on a plump housemate kaiser roll, and BECs (bacon, egg, and cheeses) on a steamy Montreal-style bagel. Layers of griddled onions and pickled veg pile high on the sandwiches, and it’s so Northeast. Here, play some darts while listening to the Grateful Dead-adjacent music setting the mood.</p><div class="iyvbja0"><button type="button" class="iyvbja1" aria-pressed="false"><svg width="12" height="10" viewBox="0 0 12 10" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path fill="c