vg>+19802071168</a></li><li><a class="hkfm3he" target="_blank" href="https://clarkssnackbar.com/" rel="noreferrer nofollow"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="hkfm3hf hkfm3hg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none"><title>Link</title><path fill="inherit" d="M16.618 13.303a6.97 6.97 0 0 0 .39-2.303 6.97 6.97 0 0 0-.412-2.366C15.624 5.935 13.038 4 10.008 4 6.978 4 4.392 5.935 3.42 8.634A6.97 6.97 0 0 0 3.008 11a6.97 6.97 0 0 0 .412 2.366C4.392 16.066 6.978 18 10.008 18c3.03 0 5.616-1.935 6.588-4.634a.481.481 0 0 0 .022-.063Zm-6.61 3.694c-.267 0-.697-.483-1.056-1.56a10.993 10.993 0 0 1-.413-1.769h2.938c-.101.65-.24 1.248-.414 1.769-.359 1.077-.789 1.56-1.055 1.56Zm-1.59-4.332a18.586 18.586 0 0 1 0-3.33h3.18a18.602 18.602 0 0 1 0 3.33h-3.18ZM4.01 11c0-.577.082-1.136.235-1.664h3.165a19.528 19.528 0 0 0 0 3.329H4.246A5.98 5.98 0 0 1 4.011 11Zm5.997-5.997c.266 0 .696.483 1.056 1.56.173.52.312 1.119.413 1.77H8.539c.1-.651.24-1.25.413-1.77.36-1.077.79-1.56 1.056-1.56Zm2.597 4.333h3.164a5.983 5.983 0 0 1 0 3.329h-3.164a19.528 19.528 0 0 0 0-3.33Zm2.772-1.004H12.49c-.179-1.23-.485-2.335-.914-3.12a6.023 6.023 0 0 1 3.801 3.12ZM8.44 5.212c-.43.785-.736 1.89-.914 3.12H4.638a6.023 6.023 0 0 1 3.802-3.12Zm-3.802 8.456h2.888c.178 1.23.484 2.335.914 3.12a6.023 6.023 0 0 1-3.802-3.12Zm6.938 3.12c.43-.785.735-1.89.914-3.12h2.887a6.023 6.023 0 0 1-3.801 3.12Z"></path></svg>Visit Website</a></li></ul><div class="hkfm3ha"><div class="_14k72og0"><div class="_14k72og2 _14k72og1 sticky-nav-trigger"></div><div class="_1fao6gze"></div></div></div></div></div><div><div class="duet--article--map-card hkfm3h0" data-slug="the-story-of-mi-carino" id="the-story-of-mi-carino"><div class="hkfm3h2"></div><div class="hkfm3h3"><h2 class="hkfm3h5">The Story of “Mi Cariño”</h2><span class="hkfm3h6"><button type="button" class="_6ylzph0" aria-label="Save to a list"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="2 2 20 20" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7.2002 20.3202L12.4176 15.0407L17.6349 20.3202V8.24064C17.6349 5.67699 15.43 3.6001 12.7113 3.6001H7.2002V20.3202Z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7"></path></svg></button></span></div><p class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup duet--article--standard-paragraph u67w0ti va4xi81 va4xi80 e8cira1 hkfm3h9">New in the heart of South End is a colorful, bright, Mexican and Latin-American gastro-cantina and mezcalería. Sit at the gorgeous backlit bar where you can sip from more than 200 of Beverage Director Henry Schmulling’s agave-based spirits, or in a comfy caramel-colored dining booth where you’re transported to a scene from <em>the Endless Summer</em>. Chef Hector Gonzalez-Mora has created a diverse, playful menu with generous portions: try the Taco Royale with ribeye steak and sourdough tortilla or the Taco Vaqueiro with bacon-wrapped banana pepper (both $14), the truffle corn dip with crackers you wish you had a bag of, and the satisfying hamachi tostada with avocado. For mains, a 14-ounce Akaushi wagyu ribeye ($78) can be the turf while the Camarones Kora, seared jumbo shrimp in butter sauce, can be the surf ($40). Leave room for a splendid, lightly sweet popcorn flan topped with cream and crunchy sorghum bits.</p><div class="iyvbja0"><button type="button" class="iyvbja1" aria-pressed="false"><svg width="12" height="10" viewBox="0 0 12 10" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path fill="currentColor" d="M11.2226 0.779264C10.1836 -0.259755 8.49832 -0.259755 7.4593 0.779264L6.00095 2.23761L4.5426 0.779264C3.50359 -0.259755 1.81828 -0.259755 0.779264 0.779264C-0.259755 1.81828 -0.259755 3.50359 0.779264 4.5426L6.00007 9.76341L11.2209 4.5426C12.2599 3.50359 12.2599 1.81828 11.2209 0.779264H11.2226Z"></path></svg>Loved it</button><button type="button" class="iyvbja1" aria-pressed="false"><svg width="12" height="10" viewBox="0 0 12 10" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path f