"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="hkfm3hf" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none"><title>Phone</title><path fill="inherit" fill-rule="evenodd" d="M8.09 5.44c.435.373.435 1.056 0 1.49L6.909 8.172c.807 1.8 2.61 3.601 4.413 4.47l1.244-1.242a1.09 1.09 0 0 1 1.554 0l1.554 1.552a1.086 1.086 0 0 1 0 1.553l-1.554 1.552C11.384 18.789.754 8.11 3.427 5.44l1.555-1.614a1.09 1.09 0 0 1 1.554 0L8.09 5.44Z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg>(704) 248-2512</a></li><li><a class="hkfm3he" target="_blank" href="https://www.leluiahall.com/" rel="noreferrer nofollow"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="hkfm3hf hkfm3hg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none"><title>Link</title><path fill="inherit" d="M16.618 13.303a6.97 6.97 0 0 0 .39-2.303 6.97 6.97 0 0 0-.412-2.366C15.624 5.935 13.038 4 10.008 4 6.978 4 4.392 5.935 3.42 8.634A6.97 6.97 0 0 0 3.008 11a6.97 6.97 0 0 0 .412 2.366C4.392 16.066 6.978 18 10.008 18c3.03 0 5.616-1.935 6.588-4.634a.481.481 0 0 0 .022-.063Zm-6.61 3.694c-.267 0-.697-.483-1.056-1.56a10.993 10.993 0 0 1-.413-1.769h2.938c-.101.65-.24 1.248-.414 1.769-.359 1.077-.789 1.56-1.055 1.56Zm-1.59-4.332a18.586 18.586 0 0 1 0-3.33h3.18a18.602 18.602 0 0 1 0 3.33h-3.18ZM4.01 11c0-.577.082-1.136.235-1.664h3.165a19.528 19.528 0 0 0 0 3.329H4.246A5.98 5.98 0 0 1 4.011 11Zm5.997-5.997c.266 0 .696.483 1.056 1.56.173.52.312 1.119.413 1.77H8.539c.1-.651.24-1.25.413-1.77.36-1.077.79-1.56 1.056-1.56Zm2.597 4.333h3.164a5.983 5.983 0 0 1 0 3.329h-3.164a19.528 19.528 0 0 0 0-3.33Zm2.772-1.004H12.49c-.179-1.23-.485-2.335-.914-3.12a6.023 6.023 0 0 1 3.801 3.12ZM8.44 5.212c-.43.785-.736 1.89-.914 3.12H4.638a6.023 6.023 0 0 1 3.802-3.12Zm-3.802 8.456h2.888c.178 1.23.484 2.335.914 3.12a6.023 6.023 0 0 1-3.802-3.12Zm6.938 3.12c.43-.785.735-1.89.914-3.12h2.887a6.023 6.023 0 0 1-3.801 3.12Z"></path></svg>Visit Website</a></li></ul><div class="hkfm3ha"><div class="_14k72og0"><div class="_14k72og2 _14k72og1 sticky-nav-trigger"></div><div class="_1fao6gze"></div></div></div></div></div><div><div class="duet--article--map-card hkfm3h0" data-slug="dozo-japanese-american-kitchen" id="dozo-japanese-american-kitchen"><div class="hkfm3h2"></div><div class="hkfm3h3"><h2 class="hkfm3h5">DŌZO Japanese American Kitchen</h2><span class="hkfm3h6"><button type="button" class="_6ylzph0" aria-label="Save to a list"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="2 2 20 20" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7.2002 20.3202L12.4176 15.0407L17.6349 20.3202V8.24064C17.6349 5.67699 15.43 3.6001 12.7113 3.6001H7.2002V20.3202Z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7"></path></svg></button></span></div><p class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup duet--article--standard-paragraph u67w0ti va4xi81 va4xi80 e8cira1 hkfm3h9">A beloved Japanese food truck and ghost kitchen has found new digs in an anchoring corner of a busy Dilworth shopping center. A dimly lit space with a humming hip-hop backtrack at pleasing decibel levels, and graffiti-painted walls welcomes diners. Once seated, select from an assortment of carefully plated izakaya specialties like the delectable spare ribs, bright and tarty beef tataki, hearty A5 wagyu gyudon comfort bowl, and crowd-pleasing tonkatsu showstopper, which is a pork cutlet topped with a mountain of shaved Brussels and cheese.</p><div class="iyvbja0"><button type="button" class="iyvbja1" aria-pressed="false"><svg width="12" height="10" viewBox="0 0 12 10" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path fill="currentColor" d="M11.2226 0.779264C10.1836 -0.259755 8.49832 -0.259755 7.4593 0.779264L6.00095 2.23761L4.5426 0.779264C3.50359 -0.259755 1.81828 -0.259755 0.779264 0.779264C-0.259755 1.81828 -0.259755 3.50359 0.779264 4.5426L6.00007 9.76341L11.2209 4.5426C12.2599 3.50359 12.2599 1.81828 11.2209 0.779264H11.2226Z"></path></svg>Loved it</button><button type="button" class="iyvbja1" aria-pressed="false"><svg width="12" height="10" viewBox="0 0 12 10" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path fill="currentColor" d="M11.9998 1.90244L10.0973 0L3.91706 6.17935L1.90244 4.16474L0 6.06808L3.91706 9.98514L11.9998 1.90244Z"></path></svg>Want to try</button></div><ul class="hkfm3hb"><li class="hkfm3hd hkfm3hc"><a class="_1win6by0" target="_blank" href="https://lyft.sng.link/Ednq0/5pb9?_dl=lyft%3A%2F%2Fbook-a-ride%3Fdestination%5Baddress%5D%3D1419+East+Blvd+a%2C+Charlotte%2C+NC+28203&amp;utm_source=eater&amp;utm_medium=eaterapp&amp;utm_campaign=CheckLyft2026_Eater_Awareness_CLT_VenueDestination&amp;utm_term=CheckLyft2026_Eater_Awareness_CLT_VenueDestination&amp;utm_content=CheckLyft2026_Eater_Awareness_CLT_VenueDestination_Static&amp;_smtype=3" rel="noreferrer nofollow"><img class="_1win6by1" src="/static-assets/icons/lyft.png" alt="" aria-hidden="true" width="17" height="12"/>Get there with Lyft<svg class="_1win6by2" width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M8.85017 5.58349L5.68241 2.38336L6.25987 1.79999L10.5 6.05807L6.39998 10.2L5.82251 9.61662L8.99818 6.40849L1.5 6.40849V5.58349L8.85017 5.58349Z"></path></svg></a></li><li><a class="hkfm3he" target="_blank" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=D%C5%8CZO%20Japanese%20American%20Kitchen%2C%201419%20East%20Blvd%20a%2C%20Charlotte%2C%20NC%2028203" rel="noreferrer nofollow"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="hkfm3hf" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none"><title>Location</title><path fill="inherit" fill-rule="evenodd" d="M9.147 2.071c-2.526.445-4.383 2.97-4.123 5.607.205 2.075 1.774 5.166 4.344 8.555.32.422.604.767.632.767.061 0 1.052-1.295 1.626-2.126 1.997-2.89 3.175-5.42 3.35-7.196.197-1.993-.843-4.033-2.57-5.041-.942-.55-2.155-.76-3.26-.566Zm1.516 2.87c1.36.443 2.02 2.036 1.394 3.367-.39.833-1.155 1.325-2.057 1.325-1.152 0-2.08-.826