quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=0%2C0.018375597206905%2C100%2C99.963248805586&amp;w=640 640w, https://platform.carolinas.eater.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/11/2025/10/dozo.webp?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=0%2C0.018375597206905%2C100%2C99.963248805586&amp;w=750 750w, https://platform.carolinas.eater.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/11/2025/10/dozo.webp?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=0%2C0.018375597206905%2C100%2C99.963248805586&amp;w=828 828w, https://platform.carolinas.eater.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/11/2025/10/dozo.webp?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=0%2C0.018375597206905%2C100%2C99.963248805586&amp;w=1080 1080w, https://platform.carolinas.eater.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/11/2025/10/dozo.webp?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=0%2C0.018375597206905%2C100%2C99.963248805586&amp;w=1200 1200w, https://platform.carolinas.eater.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/11/2025/10/dozo.webp?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=0%2C0.018375597206905%2C100%2C99.963248805586&amp;w=1440 1440w, https://platform.carolinas.eater.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/11/2025/10/dozo.webp?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=0%2C0.018375597206905%2C100%2C99.963248805586&amp;w=1920 1920w, https://platform.carolinas.eater.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/11/2025/10/dozo.webp?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=0%2C0.018375597206905%2C100%2C99.963248805586&amp;w=2048 2048w, https://platform.carolinas.eater.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/11/2025/10/dozo.webp?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=0%2C0.018375597206905%2C100%2C99.963248805586&amp;w=2400 2400w" src="https://platform.carolinas.eater.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/11/2025/10/dozo.webp?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=0%2C0.018375597206905%2C100%2C99.963248805586&amp;w=2400"/></div></div><div class="duet--media--caption _1l5wi2a1 _1l5wi2a0"><cite class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup e8cira2 _1l5wi2a6 _1l5wi2a5">Dozo</cite></div></div></div></div></div></div><div><div class="duet--article--map-card hkfm3h0" data-slug="sala" id="sala"><div class="hkfm3h2"></div><div class="hkfm3h3"><h2 class="hkfm3h5">Sala</h2><span class="hkfm3h6"><button type="button" class="_6ylzph0" aria-label="Save to a list"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="2 2 20 20" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7.2002 20.3202L12.4176 15.0407L17.6349 20.3202V8.24064C17.6349 5.67699 15.43 3.6001 12.7113 3.6001H7.2002V20.3202Z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7"></path></svg></button></span></div><p class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup duet--article--standard-paragraph u67w0ti va4xi81 va4xi80 e8cira1 hkfm3h9">Myers Park’s buzziest happy hour is at this latest addition to chef Bruce Moffet’s roster of restaurants. Opened in September and housed in the same villa as sister restaurant and Charlotte stronghold Stagioni, a grown-up, sophisticated crowd hangs out at the intimate bar or petite tables over seasonal, dessert, and Negroni cocktails and an extensive selection of European (Italian, Spanish, French, Greek) wines, champagnes, and aperitifs. Light bites like Tuscan white bean salad, olives, and almonds, and snacks like oysters with a truffle mignonette, charcuterie, ceviche, and bruschetta help you linger well into the evening (it’s open until 11 p.m.).</p><div class="iyvbja0"><button type="button" class="iyvbja1" aria-pressed="false"><svg width="12" height="10" viewBox="0 0 12 10" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path fill="currentColor" d="M11.2226 0.779264C10.1836 -0.259755 8.49832 -0.259755 7.4593 0.779264L6.00095 2.23761L4.5426 0.779264C3.50359 -0.259755 1.81828 -0.259755 0.779264 0.779264C-0.259755 1.81828 -0.259755 3.50359 0.779264 4.5426L6.00007 9.76341L11.2209 4.5426C12.2599 3.50359 12.2599 1.81828 11.2209 0.779264H11.2226Z"></path></svg>Loved it</button><button type="button" class="iyvbja1" aria-pressed="false"><svg width="12" height="10" viewBox="0 0 12 10" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg