048 2048w, https://platform.carolinas.eater.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/11/chorus/uploads/chorus_asset/file/26017756/497517932_661230030234764_1595203365651529604_n.jpg?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=0%2C5.5555555555556%2C100%2C88.888888888889&amp;w=2400 2400w" src="https://platform.carolinas.eater.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/11/chorus/uploads/chorus_asset/file/26017756/497517932_661230030234764_1595203365651529604_n.jpg?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=0%2C5.5555555555556%2C100%2C88.888888888889&amp;w=2400"/></div></div><div class="duet--media--caption _1l5wi2a1 _1l5wi2a0"><cite class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup e8cira2 _1l5wi2a6 _1l5wi2a5">Sora</cite></div></div></div></div></div></div><div><div class="duet--article--map-card hkfm3h0" data-slug="primefish-cellar" id="primefish-cellar"><div class="hkfm3h2"></div><div class="hkfm3h3"><h2 class="hkfm3h5">Primefish Cellar</h2><span class="hkfm3h6"><button type="button" class="_6ylzph0" aria-label="Save to a list"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="2 2 20 20" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7.2002 20.3202L12.4176 15.0407L17.6349 20.3202V8.24064C17.6349 5.67699 15.43 3.6001 12.7113 3.6001H7.2002V20.3202Z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7"></path></svg></button></span></div><p class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup duet--article--standard-paragraph u67w0ti va4xi81 va4xi80 e8cira1 hkfm3h9">The latest offering from the PrimeFish Group (which includes Michelin-recommended PrimeFish and Omakase by PrimeFish) functions primarily as a wine bar with sushi. What began in 2024 as a shop for high-end, gourmet victuals has transformed into a cozy sit-down space headed by Chef Robin Anthony, a 2026 James Beard Foundation Award semifinalist. Start with caviar service ($90) and a glass of champagne, then segue into a build-your-own maki experience with nori, seasonings, and a jewel box of fish, including salmon with freshly shaved black truffles, priced between $50 to $100.</p><div class="iyvbja0"><button type="button" class="iyvbja1" aria-pressed="false"><svg width="12" height="10" viewBox="0 0 12 10" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path fill="currentColor" d="M11.2226 0.779264C10.1836 -0.259755 8.49832 -0.259755 7.4593 0.779264L6.00095 2.23761L4.5426 0.779264C3.50359 -0.259755 1.81828 -0.259755 0.779264 0.779264C-0.259755 1.81828 -0.259755 3.50359 0.779264 4.5426L6.00007 9.76341L11.2209 4.5426C12.2599 3.50359 12.2599 1.81828 11.2209 0.779264H11.2226Z"></path></svg>Loved it</button><button type="button" class="iyvbja1" aria-pressed="false"><svg width="12" height="10" viewBox="0 0 12 10" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path fill="currentColor" d="M11.9998 1.90244L10.0973 0L3.91706 6.17935L1.90244 4.16474L0 6.06808L3.91706 9.98514L11.9998 1.90244Z"></path></svg>Want to try</button></div><ul class="hkfm3hb"><li class="hkfm3hd hkfm3hc"><a class="_1win6by0" target="_blank" href="https://lyft.sng.link/Ednq0/5pb9?_dl=lyft%3A%2F%2Fbook-a-ride%3Fdestination%5Baddress%5D%3D2921+Providence+Road%2C+Charlotte%2C+North+Carolina+28211%2C+United+States&amp;utm_source=eater&amp;utm_medium=eaterapp&amp;utm_campaign=CheckLyft2026_Eater_Awareness_CLT_VenueDestination&amp;utm_term=CheckLyft2026_Eater_Awareness_CLT_VenueDestination&amp;utm_content=CheckLyft2026_Eater_Awareness_CLT_VenueDestination_Static&amp;_smtype=3" rel="noreferrer nofollow"><img class="_1win6by1" src="/static-assets/icons/lyft.png" alt="" aria-hidden="true" width="17" height="12"/>Get there with Lyft<svg class="_1win6by2" width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M8.85017 5.58349L5.68241 2.38336L6.25987 1.79999L10.5 6.05807L6.39998 10.2L5.82251 9.61662L8.99818 6.40849L1.5 6.40849V5.58349L8.85017 5.58349Z"></path></svg></a></li><li><a class="hkfm3h