s, and a jewel box of fish, including salmon with freshly shaved black truffles, priced between $50 to $100."}],"primaryCampaign":null,"campaignCustomLink":null,"ledeMedia":null,"location":{"latitude":35.170832,"longitude":-80.807319},"name":"Primefish Cellar","phone":"(980) 353-0652","url":"https://primefishcellar.com/","venue":{"id":"ZXQxMTp2ZW51ZTo5Mzk5MTE=","globalId":"ZXQxMTp2ZW51ZTo5Mzk5MTE","slug":"primefish-cellar","title":"Primefish Cellar","address":"2921 Providence Road, Charlotte, North Carolina 28211, United States","ledeMedia":null,"sevenrooms":null,"safegraph":{"bookingLink":null},"opentable":null,"posts":{"nodes":[{"__typename":"MapResourceType","id":"ZXQxMTptYXA6MjY1MTg=","__isFeedContentResourceInterface":"MapResourceType","wpId":26518,"globalId":"ZXQxMTptYXA6MjY1MTg","chorusId":20930015,"chorusUuid":"3ef636bc-be38-455d-966a-7b4113ffb3bd","resourceType":"map","site":{"isCrossCommunity":false,"wpId":11},"dek":{"html":"Charlotte heats up with a destination seafood spot, sushi cellar, and an instant-hit neighborhood wine bar"},"permalink":"https://carolinas.eater.com/maps/best-new-restaurants-charlotte","title":"17 Best New Restaurants in Charlotte Right Now","publishedAt":"2026-02-02T19:21:58+00:00","authors":[{"name":"Shindy Chen","path":"/authors/shindy-chen","id":"ZXQxMTphdXRob3JQcm9maWxlOjU2NDYzNw==","permalink":"https://www.eater.com/authors/shindy-chen","shortBio":[{"html":"is a writer and creator who splits her time between Miami and her hometown of Charlotte, North Carolina."}]},{"name":"Kayleigh Ruller","path":"/authors/kayleigh-ruller","id":"ZXQxMTphdXRob3JQcm9maWxlOjU2MzkxMw==","permalink":"https://www.eater.com/authors/kayleigh-ruller","shortBio":[{"html":"Kayleigh Ruller is a freelance food journalist and travel writer based in North Carolina. Her work can be seen in \u003ci\u003eFood \u0026 Wine\u003c/i\u003e, Thrillist, Charlotte Magazine, The Charlotte Observer and other regional publications."}]}],"primaryCategory":{"title":"Charlott