tandbys and essentials, it is not a chronicle of the “it” places of the moment. Enter this Eater Heatmap, which highlights new spots under a year old and has crowds flocking and people talking. Try one of these today."}],"dropcap":false,"endmark":false,"lead":false},{"__isBlockType":"CoreParagraphBlockType","__typename":"CoreParagraphBlockType","paragraphContents":[{"html":"\u003cem\u003eNew to the list: Seaboy, Emmy Lou’s, DŌZO, Prime Fish Cellar, and the Story of Mi Cariño. Locations are listed geographically from north to south.\u003c/em\u003e"}],"dropcap":false,"endmark":false,"lead":false}],"__isResolvedResourceInterface":"MapResourceType","id":"ZXQxMTptYXA6MjY1MTg=","__isContentResourceInterface":"MapResourceType","chorusUuid":"3ef636bc-be38-455d-966a-7b4113ffb3bd","featuredImage":{"image":{"originalUrl":"https://platform.carolinas.eater.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/11/2026/02/DSC01598.jpg?quality=90\u0026strip=all","wpId":45907,"id":"ZXQxMTppbWFnZTo0NTkwNw==","thumbnails":{"horizontal":{"url":"https://platform.carolinas.eater.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/11/2026/02/DSC01598.jpg?quality=90\u0026strip=all\u0026crop=0,0.0026877385367925,100,99.994624522926"},"square":{"url":"https://platform.carolinas.eater.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/11/2026/02/DSC01598.jpg?quality=90\u0026strip=all\u0026crop=16.664874744651,0,66.670250510698,100"},"vertical":{"url":"https://platform.carolinas.eater.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/11/2026/02/DSC01598.jpg?quality=90\u0026strip=all\u0026crop=23.331899795721,0,53.336200408558,100"},"social":{"url":"https://platform.carolinas.eater.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/11/2026/02/DSC01598.jpg?quality=90\u0026strip=all\u0026crop=0,10.735095082621,100,78.529809834759","mimeType":"imageJpg","normalizedRatio":1.91,"cropCoordinates":{"height":78.52980983475896,"width":100}}},"title":"The Story of “Mi Cariño”","alt":"A plate of tacos at the Story of \"Mi Cariño\".","originalHeight":6201,"originalWidth":9301},"caption":{"html":"Try regional Mexican 